    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "A wide-angle landscape photograph of the Tokyo skyline captured during the \"golden hour.\" The image features a dense concentration of skyscrapers in the Minato ward. The iconic <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Tower\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Tokyo Tower\">Tokyo Tower</a>, a communications and observation tower inspired by the Eiffel Tower, stands prominently in the center with its distinctive white and international orange lattice. To the left is the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roppongi_Hills\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Roppongi Hills\">Roppongi Hills</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azabudai_Hills\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Azabudai Hills\">Azabudai Hills</a>. Taken from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shibuya_Stream\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Shibuya Stream\">Shibuya Stream</a>'s 35th floor.",
      "source": "commons-desc-page"
